# App Factory rules

- Follow `AGENTS.md` for role routing and stack defaults.
- Free Render plan only; ask the user before any paid plan, disk, or add-on.
- Never write secrets into the repo. Use env vars / Render dashboard secrets.
- Prefer editing existing patterns over introducing new frameworks.
- Keep PRs focused; include a short test plan in the PR body.
- When adding SQLite on free Render, document that data is ephemeral.
